        {
            "id": "meta-framework-296c50dc68f9",
            "path": "packages/db/skills/meta-framework/SKILL.md",
            "name": "meta-framework",
            "description": "Integrating TanStack DB with meta-frameworks (TanStack Start, Next.js, Remix, Nuxt, SvelteKit). Client-side only: SSR is NOT supported — routes must disable SSR. Preloading eager collections in route loaders with collection.preload(). On-demand Query Collections require preloading the live query because source collection preload is a no-op. Multiple collection preloading with Promise.all. Framework-specific loader APIs.\n",
