        {
            "id": "react-db-3f1b608b12a6",
            "path": "packages/react-db/skills/react-db/SKILL.md",
            "name": "react-db",
            "description": "React bindings for TanStack DB. Prefer useLiveQuery({ query }) with derived structured query identity. Provide queryKey only for opaque functional query variants or very hot render paths. Dependency arrays are legacy and warn before 1.0 removal. useLiveSuspenseQuery for React Suspense with Error Boundaries (data always defined). useLiveInfiniteQuery for cursor-based pagination (pageSize, fetchNextPage, hasNextPage, isFetchingNextPage). usePacedMutations for debounced React state updates. Return shape: data, state, collection, status, isLoading, isReady, isError. Import from @tanstack/react-db (re-exports all of @tanstack/db).\n",
