            "id": "solid-db-c261fa41e03c",
            "path": "packages/solid-db/skills/solid-db/SKILL.md",
            "name": "solid-db",
            "description": "SolidJS bindings for TanStack DB. useLiveQuery returns an Accessor that doubles as data access (call as function) with state/status properties. Fine-grained reactivity: signal reads MUST happen inside the query function for tracking. Config passed as Accessor (() => config). Built-in Suspense support via createResource and errors through Solid ErrorBoundary. ReactiveMap for state. Import from @tanstack/solid-db (re-exports all of @tanstack/db).\n",
